WEBVTT

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:34.990
<i>Suigin Receives a Loss!</i>

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:39.110
<i>And finally...</i>

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:42.640
<i>Finally, the day came.</i>

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:47.130
<i>The day that </i>Dungeon Century<i> 
would be discontinued.</i>

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:52.750
<i>My one way of connecting with her</i>

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:54.900
<i>was ending today,</i>

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:59.110
<i>at the stroke of midnight.</i>

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:10.520
<i>Dungeon Century</i>, the game that 
you have all spent so long playing

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.870
is having its grand finale today.

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:26.670
<i>Remember, it will be possible to carry over
 all of the currency and items</i>

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.170
<i>from this game to the
 new game, </i>Grave Buster!<i></i>

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.760
<i>Thank you all very much!</i>

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:38.650
<i>Sir, are you not heading home yet?</i>

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:42.630
I wanted to stay and watch over 
things until the very end.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.400
<i>It must mean a lot to you.</i>

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:51.020
Don't worry over an old man.
 Go ahead and head home.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.940
<i>Yes, sir. If you'll excuse me.</i>

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:01.900
It doesn't matter if I don't find anyone.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:09.890
But perhaps... I still believe in people.

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:15.290
Crap! It's way past the time 
we were supposed to meet up.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:16.470
Huh?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:33.850
Hey, master. I have a favor to ask...

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.860
BAR Yuushatei

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.270
So pretty!

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:53.050
I've never seen anything like this before.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.270
Please don't resist.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:07.760
Are you pretending to be a thief 
who just happened to pass by?

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.540
What a farce.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.430
Yes.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:16.280
I must say, since you're a coworker, 
it pains me slightly to have to dispose of you.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.860
So this is Ling's scenario, eh?

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:25.320
That definitely sounds like 
his third-rate scenario.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.100
<i>Here...</i>

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.040
<i>It just has to be here.</i>

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:36.940
<i>I know it!</i>

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:52.530
More, more...

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:54.520
Crap! Crap, crap!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:58.690
S-Save us!

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.460
What? What's going on?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.790
Who... are you?

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.160
More...

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:17.090
More!

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:23.670
What?

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:27.520
How could you...

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.640
How could you do something so horrible?!

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:38.560
So you're not going to tell us, then?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.240
How to open that tomb?

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:49.870
Did you honestly think that 
I would help you grave robbers?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:53.800
The final grave keeper, Riku Yuuki...

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.370
I thank you for your years of service.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.840
I-It's okay. I'm coming right now.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:20.890
It's the last day of the game 
that we all love so much!

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:36.890
I want more... I want all the items...

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.730
All of them!

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:51.090
Gwin...

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.220
Gwin-san...

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.800
This is a message from Ray-san.

00:06:58.740 --> 00:06:59.730
<i>Dear Gwin-san,</i>

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:07.190
<i>You seem busy, so I'm going to go ahead 
to find it. I hope you come soon. Ray.</i>

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.340
Gwin-san?

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.920
I knew you'd come...

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:31.940
You've saved me so many times,

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.130
so I wanted to thank you...

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:42.830
But I couldn't find the 
Evening Song Flower.

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:49.910
I'm sorry, Gwin-san. Thanks...

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:56.410
Thanks for everything.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.360
It was so much fun.

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:16.980
This flower...

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.770
Could this be...

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.830
The Evening Song Flower?

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.390
It's so pretty...

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:51.710
More...

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:20.960
<i>As of now, </i>Dungeon Century<i> 
has been discontinued.</i>

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:26.080
<i>Thank you all for your support.</i>

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.480
Wanchoi?

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:07.330
Good morning.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:10.000
Hi...

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.850
All this time...

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:22.980
you were the one who was with me...

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:26.150
Will you...

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:32.280
allow me to thank you 
for helping me all this time?

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:38.110
Thank me? I don't deserve 
anything like that!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:39.820
I...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.980
I wasn't able to do anything 
at the most crucial time.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.440
I couldn't even protect you...

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:52.670
I...

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:54.970
I...

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.050
Here.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:10:59.220
Huh?

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.650
Will you save me next time, then?

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:09.180
In the new game.

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:12.190
O-Of course!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:12.850
Huh?

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:23.130
Wh-What am I going to do?! 
I have to get to work!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin Inherits a Legacy!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.640
The Silver Guardian!
